          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After all response chunks and the completion message are submitted, the session exits if no valid new sentence arrives for 10 seconds. Speaking again cancels the old timer. Timing does not start at the first character, and submission does not prove the glasses finished rendering.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After all response chunks and the completion message are submitted, the session exits if no valid new sentence arrives for 10 seconds. Speaking again cancels the old timer. Timing does not start at the first character, and submission does not prove the glasses finished rendering."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "回答全部分片及完成消息提交后，10 秒无有效新句自动退出；继续说话会取消旧计时。不是从第一个字计时，提交完成也不等于镜片渲染完成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After continuous ASR wakes, it exits if no valid speech is recognized within 8 seconds. Recognition cancels that countdown; a 120-second session limit remains. Hermes computer tasks run independently and continue when audio capture ends; use the task card to stop them. DeepSeek voice tools need separate configuration. TTS is not currently available.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After continuous ASR wakes, it exits if no valid speech is recognized within 8 seconds. Recognition cancels that countdown; a 120-second session limit remains. Hermes computer tasks run independently and continue when audio capture ends; use the task card to stop them. DeepSeek voice tools need separate configuration. TTS is not currently available."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "持续 ASR 唤醒后，8 秒未收到有效识别会退出；开始识别后取消这项倒计时，单次会话保留 120 秒保护。Hermes 的电脑任务独立运行，结束收音不会停止任务；停止请用任务卡。DeepSeek 语音工具需单独配置。当前无 TTS。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After waking, audio goes to the configured Alibaba Cloud ASR and recognized text goes to %@. Charges may apply.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After waking, audio goes to the configured Alibaba Cloud ASR and recognized text goes to %@. Charges may apply."
