    "Checks roughly every two seconds while iOS allows the app to run. APNs is not integrated, so timely alerts are not guaranteed after suspension or force quit. The computer bridge keeps up to 128 events in memory and retains completion events for one hour; restarting clears them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Checks roughly every two seconds while iOS allows the app to run. APNs is not integrated, so timely alerts are not guaranteed after suspension or force quit. The computer bridge keeps up to 128 events in memory and retains completion events for one hour; restarting clears them."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
