    "Oldest to newest. Records structure and limited source identifiers only, without speech content. Identifier meanings are unverified. Cleared when the app restarts.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oldest to newest. Records structure and limited source identifiers only, without speech content. Identifier meanings are unverified. Cleared when the app restarts."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按时间从旧到新；仅记录结构与受限来源编号，不记录语音内容。编号含义尚未验证。重启 App 后清空。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Online controls, offset-based reception, Ogg/WAV, and archiving are integrated. Offline list imports, automatic resume after a cold start, and end-to-end hardware testing of the new app remain pending.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Online controls, offset-based reception, Ogg/WAV, and archiving are integrated. Offline list imports, automatic resume after a cold start, and end-to-end hardware testing of the new app remain pending."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已接在线控制、offset 接收、Ogg/WAV 与归档；离线列表导入、冷启动自动续传和新 App 真机闭环仍待。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only new events trigger alerts. Completed tasks show a summary; full results stay on this page. Alerts wait while voice, recording, or teleprompter features are using the display. A notification is not an approval.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only new events trigger alerts. Completed tasks show a summary; full results stay on this page. Alerts wait while voice, recording, or teleprompter features are using the display. A notification is not an approval."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后只提醒新事件；完成结果显示摘要，完整内容在本页。语音、录音或提词占用时等待空闲，不抢屏。提醒不是批准。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only removes the local pending verification record. It does not stop the computer task or automatically resend it. If the old request already ran, submitting again may repeat the action.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only removes the local pending verification record. It does not stop the computer task or automatically resend it. If the old request already ran, submitting again may repeat the action."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅移除本机待核对记录，不会停止电脑任务或自动重发。若旧请求已执行，再次提交可能重复操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
