    "Refreshes every two seconds while this page is in the foreground. Closing the page does not stop computer tasks. This version does not guarantee real-time iOS background notifications. You can ask “How is Codex progressing?” by voice.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Refreshes every two seconds while this page is in the foreground. Closing the page does not stop computer tasks. This version does not guarantee real-time iOS background notifications. You can ask “How is Codex progressing?” by voice."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "页面前台每两秒刷新。关闭页面不停止电脑任务；本版不承诺 iOS 后台实时通知。语音可问“Codex 进度如何”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Refreshing or dismissing the error does not clear this issue. It clears only after a full recheck passes. Historical verification records are retained.": {
