          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Markdown digest was checked before sharing. Sharing a note alone does not include audio attachments. For Obsidian, also save the corresponding audio and preserve the relative notes/ and audio/ directories.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Markdown digest was checked before sharing. Sharing a note alone does not include audio attachments. For Obsidian, also save the corresponding audio and preserve the relative notes/ and audio/ directories."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Markdown 已在分享前核对摘要。单独分享笔记不包含音频附件；若放入 Obsidian，请同时保存对应音频，并保持 notes/ 与 audio/ 的相对目录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The confirmation result needs verification and will not be sent again automatically. Refresh the status or stop the task.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The confirmation result needs verification and will not be sent again automatically. Refresh the status or stop the task."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确认结果待核对；不会自动重复发送。可刷新状态或停止任务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The device build integrates cloud ASR/VAD, Flash streaming, and continuous interruptions. Configure keys and confirm activation first. Glasses display verification for the new app is pending.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The device build integrates cloud ASR/VAD, Flash streaming, and continuous interruptions. Configure keys and confirm activation first. Glasses display verification for the new app is pending."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "真机构建接入云端 ASR/VAD、Flash 流式和连续插话，先配置密钥并确认开启；新 App 镜片验收待做。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The device build reuses the prototype communication core. Pairing, background behavior, and unpairing with the new bundle still need hardware verification. The simulator does not load the core.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The device build reuses the prototype communication core. Pairing, background behavior, and unpairing with the new bundle still need hardware verification. The simulator does not load the core."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "真机构建已复用原型通信核心。新 Bundle 的配对、后台与解绑仍需实机复验；模拟器不加载核心。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The device voice page uses verified Alibaba Cloud ASR and DeepSeek Flash. Configure Voice Service Keys, then explicitly enable standby. Other model settings remain separate drafts and do not change the actual voice service.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The device voice page uses verified Alibaba Cloud ASR and DeepSeek Flash. Configure Voice Service Keys, then explicitly enable standby. Other model settings remain separate drafts and do not change the actual voice service."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "真机语音页使用已验收的阿里云 ASR 与 DeepSeek Flash，在语音服务密钥页配置后明确开启待命。其他模型设置仍是独立草稿，不会改变实际语音服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file is currently unreadable. Return to Recording Details, reverify, and try again. The original recording is unchanged.": {
