            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此构建不加载眼镜通信库。可在上方配置后使用真实文字提问；本地流程演示仍不联网，也不代表实际收音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is a local copy with verified bytes. Decodability has not been checked, and there is no background upload.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is a local copy with verified bytes. Decodability has not been checked, and there is no background upload."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个文件是经过字节复核的本机副本；没有验证可解码性，也没有后台上传。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This only clears the local task lock left after a restart. It does not undo or rerun the original action. Verify the result before submitting a new task to avoid duplicate execution.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This only clears the local task lock left after a restart. It does not undo or rerun the original action. Verify the result before submitting a new task to avoid duplicate execution."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这只解除重启后遗留的本机任务占用，不会撤销或重跑原操作。请确认结果后再提交新任务，以免重复执行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This page explains integration boundaries. It does not send experimental commands or read the official app.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This page explains integration boundaries. It does not send experimental commands or read the official app."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本页面是集成边界说明，不会发送实验指令或读取官方 App。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This research build does not add risky operations just to complete the interface. Controls with confirmation steps will become available only after the protocol, recovery path, and target device are verified.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This research build does not add risky operations just to complete the interface. Controls with confirmation steps will become available only after the protocol, recovery path, and target device are verified."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "研究版不会为了界面完整加入危险操作。必须等协议、恢复路径和目标设备被核实后，才会开放有确认步骤的控制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
