    "Turbo IO uses its own bundle and sandbox. The device build integrates the prototype communication core and voice pipeline; the simulator does not load vendor libraries or send Bluetooth commands. Pairing, background behavior, and the glasses display still need testing with the new app on hardware.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turbo IO uses its own bundle and sandbox. The device build integrates the prototype communication core and voice pipeline; the simulator does not load vendor libraries or send Bluetooth commands. Pairing, background behavior, and the glasses display still need testing with the new app on hardware."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turbo IO使用独立 Bundle 与沙盒。真机构建已接入原型通信核心与语音链路；模拟器构建不加载厂商库或发蓝牙指令。新 App 的配对、后台与镜片效果还需真机复验。"
          }
        }
      }
