    "Collects up to 80 events only while enabled. Text is not written to logs or disk. Disabling clears the cache and token. If iOS suspends the app, the computer shows that the data connection is lost.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Collects up to 80 events only while enabled. Text is not written to logs or disk. Disabling clears the cache and token. If iOS suspends the app, the computer shows that the data connection is lost."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅在开启期间收集，最多80条事件；文字不写入日志或磁盘。关闭会清空缓存与令牌。若 App 被挂起，电脑会显示数据失联。"
          }
