      }
    },
    "This mode asks the glasses to try an unverified native follow setting. The glasses may use its microphone; firmware network use and charges are unknown. Norman IO does not record or transcribe this audio. Test with a short script; exit before changing modes.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This mode asks the glasses to try an unverified native follow setting. The glasses may use its microphone; firmware network use and charges are unknown. Norman IO does not record or transcribe this audio. Test with a short script; exit before changing modes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此模式向眼镜请求尚未验证的原生跟读设置。眼镜可能使用麦克风；固件是否联网及产生费用尚不清楚。Norman IO 不录制或转写这路音频。请用短稿测试；切换模式前先退出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try native following on the glasses? AI standby will pause. The glasses firmware controls microphone and network use; verify with a short script.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
