        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sends only the current segment, up to 12,000 characters, not the entire book. Playback can start only after a script-received response. Progress from the glasses is reported as received and is not equated with phone pagination. Smart speech tracking is not enabled."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只发当前分段（最多 12,000 字），不发整本书。收到收稿回应后才允许开始；眼镜上报原始进度，不假装等于手机分页。未启用智能跟读。"
