    "Sends content only, preserving the dashboard layout. The small home weather display and city cards use separate channels. Icon IDs and glasses display behavior need hardware reverification. This does not automatically access location, fetch online weather, or refresh in the background.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sends content only, preserving the dashboard layout. The small home weather display and city cards use separate channels. Icon IDs and glasses display behavior need hardware reverification. This does not automatically access location, fetch online weather, or refresh in the background."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只发送内容，不替换已有看板布局。首页小天气与城市卡片是两个通道；图标编号和镜片效果需实机复验。当前没有自动获取位置、联网查天气或后台刷新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
