    "Fetches and sends only after an authenticated connection. Fresh results can be reused on reconnect. The dashboard layout stays unchanged. Updates wait during recording, conversation, or teleprompter use. Requires a weather-specific key and verified icon mapping.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fetches and sends only after an authenticated connection. Fresh results can be reused on reconnect. The dashboard layout stays unchanged. Updates wait during recording, conversation, or teleprompter use. Requires a weather-specific key and verified icon mapping."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只在认证连接后获取并下发；新鲜结果可用于重连。不会改看板布局；录音、对话或提词中会延后。需天气专用 Key 和已核对的图标映射。"
