    "Finds received files after an app restart. Does not connect to the glasses, start recording, request offline retransmission, or delete originals. Recovery can be attempted only for older packaged tasks or tasks with a retained end record and no gaps in received coverage.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Finds received files after an app restart. Does not connect to the glasses, start recording, request offline retransmission, or delete originals. Recovery can be attempted only for older packaged tasks or tasks with a retained end record and no gaps in received coverage."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用于 App 重启后的接收文件找回。不会连接眼镜、开录、申请离线补传或删除原件。已封装的旧任务，或保留结束记录且覆盖无空洞的任务，才可尝试恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
