    "On your iPhone, go to Settings → Bluetooth → Glasses Details and allow system notification sharing. Source apps also need notification permission. Focus mode and preview settings may affect what appears. Turbo IO does not change these settings for you.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On your iPhone, go to Settings → Bluetooth → Glasses Details and allow system notification sharing. Source apps also need notification permission. Focus mode and preview settings may affect what appears. Turbo IO does not change these settings for you."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在 iPhone 设置 → 蓝牙 → 眼镜详情中允许共享系统通知。来源 App 也需要系统通知权限；专注模式、预览设置等可能影响实际显示。Turbo IO不会替你更改这些设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
