            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These are configurable sources, not a list of installed apps. The protocol sends Bundle IDs for disabled sources; unknown apps are not automatically blocked. Applying for the first time replaces the previous source filters."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些是可配置的来源，不是手机已安装 App 清单。协议发送关闭项的 Bundle ID；未知 App 不会自动被拒绝。首次应用会替换原来源过滤配置。"
          }
        }
      }
